# secret-scan reports (the .secrets.baseline IS committed; ad-hoc reports are not)
.secrets.report.json

# generated knowledge base (rendered by bw_generate_docs) goes to output/, never committed
# (output/ and extracts/ are already ignored above)

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# local landscape reference (internal endpoints; never commit)
landscape.local.md

# ad-hoc probe/verification scratch scripts and their output. These run against a live system and
# routinely carry concrete object names, so they must never be committed (see SECURITY.md).
tmp_*

